# Build and generation output.
#
# Every pattern here is anchored with a leading slash, so it matches only at the
# repository root. An unanchored "gen/" matches a directory of that name at any
# depth, which silently excluded internal/gen -- the package that emits every
# language -- and left the build unable to resolve it.
/dist/
/build/
/gen/
/out/
/xsd2code-go
/xsd2code-go.exe
*.exe

# The binary the release pipeline stages for nfpm.
/packaging/xsd2code-go
